# Frame budget: a fight by a factory (GODMODE keeps it going): turrets' flak,
# jets, boats, bombs and explosions, the scroller. The average is 55-75% (A500);
# the worst game frames (~93%) are a bomb landing on a factory (the blast, the
# factory's tiles, the fireball, the sound starting) and a scroll column with
# the serial state line at dusk; the theatre card's last picture, where the play
# starts, ~85%. None is dropped. (1.5 before the fix: 100% on both.)
wait-serial "AGK t0" 3000   # (the floppy loads run after the splash: seconds)
wait 10
press fire 2
wait-serial "theatre loaded=0"
# (the theatre card first: a fresh press of fire skips it)
wait 3
press fire 1
wait 24
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x0A
wait 30
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x09
wait 20
checkpoint fight
press fire2 2
wait 30
press fire 1
wait 10
press fire 1
wait 600
press left+up 120
wait 300
expect-no-dropped-frames
expect-max-load 95
expect-min-chip-free 64
